### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### DATABASE (Prisma)
###
### DATABASE_PROVIDER controls which database engine Prisma uses.
### Supported values: postgresql | mysql | sqlite | mongodb
###
### SQL (PostgreSQL / MySQL / SQLite) — run:
###   npm run db:generate   (generate client from prisma/schema.prisma)
###   npm run db:migrate    (create & apply migrations)
###
### MongoDB — run:
###   cp prisma/schema.mongodb.prisma prisma/schema.prisma
###   npm run db:generate:mongo
###   npm run db:push:mongo
###
### Examples:
###   postgresql  →  postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DBNAME
###   mysql       →  mysql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:3306/DBNAME
###   sqlite      →  file:./dev.db
###   mongodb     →  mongodb+srv://USER:PASSWORD@cluster.mongodb.net/DBNAME
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_PROVIDER="postgresql"
DATABASE_URL=""

